  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have added scanlation reader functionality to the tracking platform:\n\n- **Webtoon & Manga Reader Interface (`ReaderView.tsx`)**:\n  - **Reading Layout Modes**: Webtoon continuous vertical long-strip scrolling, single-page view with tap/keyboard shortcuts, and double-page spread.\n  - **Customization Controls**: Adjustable strip maximum widths (`700px`, `850px`, `1000px`, `100%`), canvas background color themes (*Deep Slate*, *Pitch Black*, *Charcoal*), and page gap settings.\n  - **Reading Controls**: Top navigation header bar with quick chapter dropdown, progress percentage bar, auto-mark chapter as read when scrolling past 85%, and fullscreen toggle (`F`).\n  - **End-of-Chapter Actions**: Chapter completion cards with quick navigation to the next chapter and return to library buttons.\n\n- **Chapter List Feed Browser (`ChapterListModal.tsx`)**:\n  - Browse scanlation chapter lists with real-time title & chapter number filtering, sort order toggle (*Newest First* vs *Oldest First*), and release date / scanlation group metadata tags.\n  - Quick action banner to resume reading at the current progress point.\n\n- **Seamless Library Integration**:\n  - **Library Cards & Table View**: Added direct **\"Read Ch. X\"** and **\"All Chapters\"** launcher controls to every tracked series.\n  - **Series Details Drawer**: Integrated reader launch buttons directly into the series summary page."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
